{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers","id":607816,"title":"Demonic powers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-30T06:59:11-07:00","id":607816,"title":"Demonic powers","content":"I've got a few questions about what it is possble to do with some Exploits and Demonic Form powers:<br /> -Can a demon use Teleportation to go to a place they're seeing through Clairvoyant Sight?<br /> -Can a Demon with Ephemeral Cover make pacts with ghosts and spirits?<br /> -Can a Demon without Cover use Possession to hide from the Machine?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T08:42:42-07:00","id":607931,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anteros</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers#post607816\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-Can a Demon with Ephemeral Cover make pacts with ghosts and spirits?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, what with their lacking both souls and mortal lives to cut and paste bits from.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> -Can a Demon without Cover use Possession to hide from the Machine? </div> </div> </div>Ostensibly, yes, but that twice-daily compromise check is going to be a nightmare in the long term.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T10:09:17-07:00","id":608116,"title":"","content":"Thank you for your answers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T12:45:18-07:00","id":608350,"title":"","content":"On Clairvoyant Sight and Teleportation: I'd say they can be used together, yes (in fact this very question was already asked and it seemed like an unanimous ruling, so you'd be safe doing so).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T13:09:09-07:00","id":608377,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anteros</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers#post607816\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've got a few questions about what it is possble to do with some Exploits and Demonic Form powers:<br /> -Can a demon use Teleportation to go to a place they're seeing through Clairvoyant Sight?</div> </div> </div> </div> Nope. Clairvoyance isn't the same thing as line of sight. Long distance teleports are what powers like Behind the Curtain are for.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> -Can a Demon with Ephemeral Cover make pacts with ghosts and spirits? </div> </div> </div> Who said you needed the Ephermeral Cover to make such pacts in the first place? The hardest part is getting a physical object to write the pact down on.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> -Can a Demon without Cover use Possession to hide from the Machine? </div> </div> </div> Sure. They can also use Forge Relationship to make up a faux Cover on the spot, and a few other tricks.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T15:19:38-07:00","id":608499,"title":"","content":"More to the point, pacts need to be signed in blood.<br /> <br /> Getting blood out of a ghost may prove difficult.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T15:23:35-07:00","id":608504,"title":"","content":"Non Soul pacts do not need to be signed in blood iirc...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5718-hackthulhu","name":"Hackthulhu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5718_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T15:37:15-07:00","id":608514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hackthulhu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers?p=608504#post608504\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Non Soul pacts do not need to be signed in blood iirc...</div> </div> </div> </div>Spirits are going to have a hard time supplying human connections and ghosts kind of <i>need those</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T15:46:59-07:00","id":608524,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xenesis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers?p=608499#post608499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More to the point, pacts need to be signed in blood.<br /> <br /> Getting blood out of a ghost may prove difficult.</div> </div> </div> </div> All Pacts require a physical medium for the terms of agreement. Paper, leather, stone, bones, bronze, etc. Once the Pact is sealed, the object containing the terms gets extra Durability to make it more resistant against deliberate harming and erosion. I am pretty sure digital Pacts are not allowed by the core rule book. Willpower Dots have to be sacrificed. You cannot use supernatural powers to force someone into signing. That would be you that's signing with their severed hand, so to say. Torture and blackmail are A-OK, as far as Demons and other spies are concerned.<br /> <br /> A Soul Pact requires all of that AND that the ink be made out of blood from both parties involved. Ghosts, as a literary creature, are not the people they were, in every way that can be interpreted. NWOD Spirits were never people to begin with, and as a rule, they don't have any unique advantages that you could steal by impersonating them. You are better off just bribing ghosts and spirits with the things you know they want the most so they'll risk non-life and Corpus to do your bidding. And if they feel like complaining about the unsatisfying resolution of the mundane deal, well...<br /> <br /> &quot;I did as we agreed, both to the letter and *quick chuckle* spirit. If you wanted more details, you should have asked. You can Blast me if you want, but you'd be wasting your Essence. You would also look none too elegant if your Choir thinks you are becoming a Revenge magath.&quot;<br /> <br /> (I wanna make that a quote for a snarky Unchained diplomat now.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 07-30-2015, 06:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-31T05:35:02-07:00","id":609279,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xenesis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers?p=608499#post608499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More to the point, pacts need to be signed in blood.<br /> <br /> Getting blood out of a ghost may prove difficult.</div> </div> </div> </div> Some ghosts are naturally bloody, especially those of the Torn threshold. I don't see why that wouldn't count if the ghost can materialize.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers?p=608514#post608514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Spirits are going to have a hard time supplying human connections and ghosts kind of <i>need those</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div> Depends on the kind of human connection they're trading; spirits can grow cults, which can then be traded away. And ghosts don't <i>need </i>human connections, they need anchors. A ghost driven by revenge or unfinished business could bargain away his friends at the golf course if it means avenging his death. Also, not all pacts need to involve the demon getting a Cover.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GottaGoFeast</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers?p=608524#post608524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I am pretty sure digital Pacts are not allowed by the core rule book.</div> </div> </div> </div> Ish? The pact must be written on something that's fairly permanent. And digital is generally not permanent. Plus, the contract needs to be signed by their own hands, which is hard on a computer. That said, if we inscribe the pact digitally onto a CD, the ST might rule that original CD counts as the pact, even though its in a digital format.<br /> <br /> Okay, that's admittedly a stretch.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Willpower Dots have to be sacrificed. </div> </div> </div> Only for soul pacts. For others, its only temporary willpower points.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Ghosts, as a literary creature, are not the people they were, in every way that can be interpreted. NWOD Spirits were never people to begin with, and as a rule, they don't have any unique advantages that you could steal by impersonating them. </div> </div> </div> I disagree on both counts. I can argue that, if we define people as the sum of their memories and experiences, then I'd say ghosts qualify. And I disagree that its a rule that spirits won't have anything to offer through pact or impersonation via Ephemeral Cover (don't think you can do impersonation with just pact). There are some that will have something.<br /> <br /> Unless you don't want to risk said ghost or spirit being caught by the God Machine for various reasons. Or you want to keep your plans as secret as possible. Etc<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T19:32:16-07:00","id":612904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers?p=608377#post608377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Nope. Clairvoyance isn't the same thing as line of sight. <b>Long distance teleports are what powers like Behind the Curtain are for.</b></div> </div> </div> </div>Given the capabilities of the Dataform form power, this argument really doesn't hold water.<br /> <br /> So, since one can get a single form power that allows long distance movement any place with internet/wi-fi/other data sending/receiving capacity for a small Aether cost (one per turn it's active, with one turn allowing transportation to anywhere on the same continent or two turns for overseas travel) and it also makes one relatively invulnerable while active, I don't see a problem with combining the functions of two separate form powers to teleport to any place or person one has been to or seen within the last month for one Aether.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thread Reaper <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">\uff1c(\u00b4 \u055e)\u0a0a( \u055e )\uff1e\ufeff</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/377-xanandithras","name":"Xanandithras","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar377_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"427"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-03T03:38:26-07:00","id":613198,"title":"","content":"One of the writes for the book answered this question and the answer was sure if you want. If a player wants to use up 2 form abilities to do what Behind the Cutain or Data Form can do cool. But i would rather them have Data Form so I can run Tron adventures","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4090-mental-state","name":"Mental-State","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-03T08:05:21-07:00","id":613368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanandithras</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers?p=612904#post612904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given the capabilities of the Dataform form power, this argument really doesn't hold water.</div> </div> </div> </div> It does if I say that Dataform is a power that's like Behind the Curtain, since it does much of the same thing except instead of transporting to Infrastructure, you're teleporting to somewhere with active wi-fi or cell phone reception. I never said, nor intended to say, &quot;No Processes and only Exploits!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T12:54:30-07:00","id":648277,"title":"","content":"Does the Blind Sense Technology allow to perceive creaures in Twilight?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T13:44:15-07:00","id":648315,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anteros</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers?p=648277#post648277\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does the Blind Sense Technology allow to perceive creaures in Twilight?</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't allow it. It works like a very keen tactile sense for the effects of a presence \u2013 sound waves, air displacement \u2013 which beings in Twilight don't produce. If the being manifested, even some partial manifestations like making noise, you could pinpoint the source then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T16:15:57-07:00","id":648445,"title":"","content":"Apart from this, do Unchained have a mean of seeing unmanifested Ephemeral beings?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T23:22:57-07:00","id":648594,"title":"","content":"I don't think so? The lack of ability to do so has come up in NTDA a few times. There could be something stuck somewhere we are missing. It could be an Interlock of course.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T08:53:44-07:00","id":649009,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Here is a homebrew demonic form ability I did for one of my players whose background involved ghosts.<br /> <br /> <b>Demonic Form - Modification</b><br /> <br /> Spectral Sight - Angels that deal with the souls of the dead need to be able to see them, this modification allows the demon to see ghosts and any other ghost-like ephemera.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">Appearance: The demons eyes have a eerie green glow or a whit filmy smoke over them.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">System: The demon can see ghosts and any other ghost-like ephemera while they only exists in Twilight.</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":1329,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","user":"ElvesofZion","date":".  Removed copy/paste color tags 09-02-2015, 11:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T09:08:40-07:00","id":649045,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anteros</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers?p=648445#post648445\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Apart from this, do Unchained have a mean of seeing unmanifested Ephemeral beings?</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on what kind of ephemera. I have the impression that it is intentional that demonic powers aren't especially great at seeing angels flit through the world in Twilight. Powers like Sense the Angelic have a relatively high opportunity cost (you can't just casually pick up another Modification, you're limited to how many you can develop at a given time over the course of your life as a demon), and still produce a limited result (you only sense angelic presence when they're actively influencing the world). It's a spy game, so it's important that each side has difficulty easily ferreting out the other.<br /> <br /> Other types of ephemera are a different story. The Demon Translation Guide suggests the ability to perceive ghosts and spirits in Twilight as a Modification (so actually a little broader than EoZ's player's power). I could see Embeds, Exploits or Interlocks that could accomplish similar results, though likely with wrinkles of their own rather than simple and straightforward spirit-sight. To provide an example, I have a character in an ongoing game who is an occasional contributor to Network Zero, and with the ST's permission she's gotten access to some Monster Media from the Compacts &amp; Conspiracies supplement. She's been experimenting with it over the course of arcs, with the expectation that eventually she'll be able to develop an Embed or Exploit that causes most supernatural presences to show up on recording media. Break her camera (and keep her from pulling out another) and the power does her no good.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T09:27:08-07:00","id":649055,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anteros</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers?p=648445#post648445\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Apart from this, do Unchained have a mean of seeing unmanifested Ephemeral beings?</div> </div> </div> </div> Well, first lets say something first. You usually don't just see generic &quot;ephemeral beings.&quot; You end up with ghost-vision, angel-vision, goetic-vision, or spirit-vision. They all run on different &quot;frequencies&quot; despite all using essence. If you adopt a ghost Emphemeral Cover, you automatically get into that frequency, and can see and interact with said beings. <br /> <br /> As special function machines, it makes sense that they'd need specific parts to deal with a ghost, then a different part for a spirit, etc.<br /> <br /> If you want to adapt something quickly for the game, however? Take the Deep Cover Embed or Emphemeral Cover exploits, and install it into a pair of goggles. Viola. It should be enough to see the critters in question.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baron Samedi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers?p=648594#post648594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think so? The lack of ability to do so has come up in NTDA a few times. There could be something stuck somewhere we are missing. It could be an Interlock of course.</div> </div> </div> </div> You'll also notice that there are several instances of powers that interact with and detect an angel's ephemeral nature. You can detect angels when they use Numina, or somehow produce aether. You can tell when they've used powers to influence humans, or build up Infrastructure. <br /> <br /> At no point do you ever get the ability to detect the angels directly without adapting an Ephemeral Cover (likely needing the Jacked In Condition as well), and that's assuming they're not possessing someone. I think this is deliberate. Demon is a spy game, and both angels and demons are meant to be paranoid. You're supposed to be paranoid about being watched and followed, never knowing who's looking over your shoulder. <br /> <br /> I think that its very deliberate that demons cannot see ephemeral beings directly. Its thematic for the demons to be unable to see angels that way, so they're always guessing. And, as for other ephemeral beings? Well, they likely get the same treatment so we don't end up adapting the ghost-hunting stuff for angel-hunting, which would be unthematic.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T09:57:25-07:00","id":649078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers?p=649055#post649055\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At no point do you ever get the ability to detect the angels directly without adapting an Ephemeral Cover (likely needing the Jacked In Condition as well)</div> </div> </div> </div>Note that Ephemeral Cover can only produce Covers as ghosts or spirits, not angels. Since they're different types of ephemera, neither ghosts nor spirits can naturally perceive angels in Twilight, so even this plan wouldn't work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T11:02:22-07:00","id":649124,"title":"","content":"Well, that should make ghost hunting more complicated, indeed.<br /> Do psychopomp angels have to manifest to interact with spirits and ghosts, then?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T11:48:01-07:00","id":649151,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anteros</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers?p=649124#post649124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, that should make ghost hunting more complicated, indeed.<br /> Do psychopomp angels have to manifest to interact with spirits and ghosts, then?</div> </div> </div> </div> I'd imagine they have something akin to the Ghost Eater Numen, allowing them to interact with what they need to for that mission.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T11:54:22-07:00","id":649153,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers?p=649078#post649078\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Note that Ephemeral Cover can only produce Covers as ghosts or spirits, not angels. Since they're different types of ephemera, neither ghosts nor spirits can naturally perceive angels in Twilight, so even this plan wouldn't work.</div> </div> </div> </div> You know, I never noticed that ghost/spirit only requirement. I thought it worked on all four ephemeral entities, including goetics and angels. Huh. Well, consider me corrected. You still can form Covers as a ghost or spirit to see ghosts and spirits repectively, though, so that should work.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anteros</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/607816-demonic-powers?p=649124#post649124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, that should make ghost hunting more complicated, indeed.<br /> Do psychopomp angels have to manifest to interact with spirits and ghosts, then?</div> </div> </div> </div> Well, they'd probably have an Influence or Numina that lets them interact with the ghosts or spirits. But, yes, they'd need to be built with some specific ability to interact with ghosts and spirits, since they cannot by default.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}